ường 64 bytes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2190&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2195&quot; data-end=&quot;2245&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;⚙️ 4. Cache trong CPU pipeline (liên hệ thực tế)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2247&quot; data-end=&quot;2273&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;Cache trực tiếp ảnh hưởng:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2275&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;✔ Instruction Fetch&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2337&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2337&quot;&gt;L1 I-cache cấp instruction mỗi cycle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2356&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;✔ Data Access&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2383&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2383&quot;&gt;Load/store từ L1 D-cache&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2385&quot; data-end=&quot;2397&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;👉 Nếu miss:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2398&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2398&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;Pipeline bị &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2412&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;stall&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot;&gt;Superscalar bị “nghẽn”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2448&quot; data-end=&quot;2451&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2453&quot; data-end=&quot;2487&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;🚨 5. Cache và hiệu năng thực tế&lt