ot; data-end=&quot;2586&quot;&gt;Spatial locality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2586&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;Dữ liệu gần nhau → thường dùng cùng&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2629&quot; data-end=&quot;2632&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2634&quot; data-end=&quot;2657&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;⚙️ Chính sách cache&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2659&quot; data-end=&quot;2745&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2659&quot; data-end=&quot;2685&quot;&gt;Replacement: LRU, FIFO&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2686&quot; data-end=&quot;2745&quot;&gt;Write:&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2745&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2697&quot; data-end=&quot;2712&quot;&gt;Write-through&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2715&quot; data-end=&quot;2745&quot;&gt;Write-back (thường dùng hơn)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2747&quot; data-end=&quot;2750&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2752&quot; data-end=&quot;2781&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;🔗 Kết nối Pipeline + Cache&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2783&quot; data-end=&quot;2807&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;👉 Pipeline nhanh nhưng:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2808&quot; data-end=&quot;2853&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2808&quot; data-end=&quot;2853&quot;&gt;Nếu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2814&quot; data-end=&quot;2828&quot;&gt;cache miss&lt;/strong&gt; → pipeline bị stall 😬&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2855&quot; data-end=&quot;2865&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;👉 Vì vậy:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2866&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2866&quot; data-end=&quot;2900&quot;&gt;Cache tốt = pipeline chạy mượt&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2901&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;Cache tệ = CPU “đợi RAM” là chính&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;2941&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2943&quot; data-end=&quot;2984&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;🚀 Liên hệ thực tế (Embedded + Edge AI)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2986&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;Trong hệ thống bạn đang hướng tới:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3053&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;🧠 Khi chạy YOLOv8 trên SoC&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3054&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3054&quot; data-end=&quot;3087&quot;&gt;CPU pipeline xử lý control flow&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3088&quot; data-end=&quot;3102&quot;&gt;NPU xử lý AI&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3103&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot;&gt;Cache giúp:&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3119&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3119&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;giảm latency khi load tensor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot;&gt;tăng throughput&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3171&quot; data-end=&quot;3174&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3196&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;📌 Ví dụ thực tế&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3197&quot; data-end=&quot;3273&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3197&quot; data-end=&quot;3230&quot;&gt;DMA load dữ liệu từ RAM → cache&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3231&quot; data-end=&quot;3273&quot;&gt;CPU đọc từ cache → xử lý nhanh hơn nhiều&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3275&quot; data-end=&quot;3278&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;3280&quot; data-end=&quot;3299&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;🎯 Tóm tắt dễ nhớ&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3301&quot; data-end=&quot;3427&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3301&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3303&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;Pipeline = tăng tốc bằng song song&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3342&quot; data-end=&quot;3372&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3344&quot; data-end=&quot;3372&quot;&gt;Cache = giảm chậm do RAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3373&quot; data-end=&quot;3427&quot;&gt;Hai cái này kết hợp → quyết định performance thực tế&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
