vs senior”&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2823&quot; data-end=&quot;2844&quot;&gt;🧠 System thinking&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2845&quot; data-end=&quot;2914&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2845&quot; data-end=&quot;2887&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bottleneck ở đâu? CPU hay memory hay IO?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2888&quot; data-end=&quot;2914&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Khi nào dùng NPU vs CPU?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2916&quot; data-end=&quot;2919&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2921&quot; data-end=&quot;2945&quot;&gt;🔄 End-to-end mindset&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2946&quot; data-end=&quot;2956&quot;&gt;Không chỉ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;blockquote data-start=&quot;2957&quot; data-end=&quot;2976&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2959&quot; data-end=&quot;2976&quot;&gt;“model chạy được”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2978&quot; data-end=&quot;2986&quot;&gt;Mà phải:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;blockquote data-start=&quot;2987&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2989&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;“camera → detect → stream → latency &amp;lt; 50ms”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3034&quot; data-end=&quot;3037&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3039&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;🧰 Debug kỹ năng cao&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3063&quot; data-end=&quot;3099&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3063&quot; data-end=&quot;3068&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;GDB&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3069&quot; data-end=&quot;3086&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;strace / ltrace&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3099&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;log kernel&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3101&quot; data-end=&quot;3104&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;3106&quot; data-end=&quot;3148&quot;&gt;8. Roadmap học thực tế (rất khuyến nghị)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3150&quot; data-end=&quot;3176&quot;&gt;Giai đoạn 1 (1–2 tháng)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3177&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3177&quot; data-end=&quot;3195&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;C + Linux cơ bản&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Làm project:&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3213&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3213&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;camera capture + hiển thị&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3242&quot; data-end=&quot;3245&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3247&quot; data-end=&quot;3273&quot;&gt;Giai đoạn 2 (2–3 tháng)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3274&quot; data-end=&quot;3315&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3274&quot; data-end=&quot;3299&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chạy YOLOv8 trên Jetson&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3300&quot; data-end=&quot;3315&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hiểu pipeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3317&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3322&quot; data-end=&quot;3348&quot;&gt;Giai đoạn 3 (3–6 tháng)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3349&quot; data-end=&quot;3403&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3349&quot; data-end=&quot;3388&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Port model sang NPU (RKNN / TensorRT)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3389&quot; data-end=&quot;3403&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Optimize FPS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3405&quot; data-end=&quot;3408&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3410&quot; data-end=&quot;3434&quot;&gt;Giai đoạn 4 (advance)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3435&quot; data-end=&quot;3500&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3435&quot; data-end=&quot;3476&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Viết driver / tối ưu memory / zero-copy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3477&quot; data-end=&quot;3500&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Multi-thread pipeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3502&quot; data-end=&quot;3505&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3539&quot;&gt;9. Một project mẫu bạn NÊN làm&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3541&quot; data-end=&quot;3566&quot;&gt;👉 “Smart Camera Edge AI”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3568&quot; data-end=&quot;3647&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3568&quot; data-end=&quot;3600&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Camera → detect người (YOLOv8)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3601&quot; data-end=&quot;3611&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tracking&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3612&quot; data-end=&quot;3629&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stream qua RTSP&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3630&quot; data-end=&quot;3647&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Latency &amp;lt; 100ms&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3649&quot; data-end=&quot;3652&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;3654&quot; data-end=&quot;3689&quot;&gt;10. Tóm lại (ngắn gọn nhưng thật)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3691&quot; data-end=&quot;3705&quot;&gt;Bạn cần 4 trụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;3707&quot; data-end=&quot;3833&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3707&quot; data-end=&quot;3736&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3710&quot; data-end=&quot;3736&quot;&gt;Embedded (C, hardware)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3737&quot; data-end=&quot;3765&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3740&quot; data-end=&quot;3765&quot;&gt;Linux system + driver&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3766&quot; data-end=&quot;3796&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3769&quot; data-end=&quot;3796&quot;&gt;AI model + optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3797&quot; data-end=&quot;3833&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3800&quot; data-end=&quot;3833&quot;&gt;System integration (pipeline)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;208&quot;&gt;Để thiết kế một hệ thống nhúng chạy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;36&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;Edge AI (Linux + NPU + CPU + LPU, chạy model như YOLOv8)&lt;/strong&gt;, bạn không thể học kiểu “một mảng là đủ”. Nó là sự giao thoa của &lt;strong data-start=&quot;162&quot; data-end=&quot;207&quot;&gt;embedded + system + AI + tối ưu phần cứng&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;Mình sẽ chia thẳng theo roadmap thực tế (từ nền → nâng cao → build được hệ thống hoàn chỉnh):&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;305&quot; data-end=&quot;308&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;310&quot; data-end=&quot;354&quot;&gt;1. Nền tảng bắt buộc (không có là “toang”)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;🔧 C/C++ + Embedded fundamentals&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;&#xa;C (quan trọng hơn C++)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;&#xa;Memory (stack/heap, DMA, cache)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;488&quot;&gt;&#xa;Bitwise, register-level programming&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&#xa;Interrupt, concurrency&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;515&quot; data-end=&quot;587&quot;&gt;👉 Nếu bạn đã từng làm UART + DMA + FreeRTOS → rất tốt, đang đúng hướng.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;592&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;⚡ Kiến trúc máy tính (Computer Architecture)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;642&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;642&quot; data-end=&quot;674&quot;&gt;&#xa;CPU pipeline, cache (L1/L2/L3)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;675&quot; data-end=&quot;696&quot;&gt;&#xa;MMU, virtual memory&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;697&quot; data-end=&quot;712&quot;&gt;&#xa;Bus: AXI, AHB&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;&#xa;Peripheral mapping&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;794&quot;&gt;👉 Đây là phần giúp bạn hiểu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;764&quot; data-end=&quot;794&quot;&gt;tại sao AI chạy nhanh/chậm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;799&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;801&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;🔌 Digital + Hardware cơ bản&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;927&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot;&gt;&#xa;GPIO, SPI, I2C, UART&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;877&quot;&gt;&#xa;Clock, power domain&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;878&quot; data-end=&quot;927&quot;&gt;&#xa;PCB basics (không cần quá sâu, nhưng phải hiểu)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;934&quot; data-end=&quot;985&quot;&gt;2. Embedded Linux (cực kỳ quan trọng cho Edge AI)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;987&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;🐧 Linux system&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt